      "Original": "And that's 100.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_01_07_05_Novel_00029_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Uuurggh... Call the ambulance!",
